# Ministerial Expenditures by Standard Object (dmac-meso) editions feed the
# department miniSankey standard-object breakdown; committed for reproducibility
# (one edition per Public Accounts year 2014–2025; ≤2023 keep the -fra editions
# for official French object labels).
!/open_tables/data/dmac-meso-*.csv
# External Expenses by Segment and by Type (cest-eest, Vol I Table 3.6) editions
